- * blend. Entry is discrete: a pair enters shared mode immediately when the
- * one-time snap is invisible (within MAX_ENTRY_DISCREPANCY); otherwise the
- * classified relation is RETAINED, the JOINER stays fully native (never
- * chasing the target), and the pair switches ONCE at the next master
- * rollover - where the authoritative target sits on a real route vertex.
- * Waiting never depends on native drift closing the gap. Only real recorded movement edges are ever rendered:
